    "make_it":  [
                    "Add the chicken, drained chickpeas, diced tomatoes, chopped onion, sliced carrots, olive oil, broth, garlic, and lime juice to the slow cooker. Add the coriander, cumin, turmeric, cinnamon, ginger, salt, and pepper.",
                    "Stir everything together so the spices and liquid coat the chicken and vegetables.",
                    "Cover and cook on low for 6 to 7 hours until the chicken shreds and the carrots are tender.",
                    "Shred the chicken into the stew, stir in the chopped cilantro, and let it simmer together for a few minutes.",
                    "Spoon the tagine over white rice with plenty of the tomatoey broth."
